// The names the dashboard's script parts share through window.dash
// (tab/src/dash/js/*.js, joined in order by src/console-page.js; how a
// part hands a name over is in tab/CLAUDE.md, The script's parts). Read
// by tsconfig.dash.json; nothing here is served.
//
// Every member is optional because dash starts empty and each part adds
// its own as it runs; a read is checked for the name and, for a
// function, for how many arguments it takes. A parameter is optional
// where some caller leaves it out.

// what the parts keep between them (core.js makes it, the tabs add theirs)
